  (FOsat e (FOLOG2c B d) <->
   exists P Q R, FOeval e d = cpair 2 (cpair
     (cpair 2 (cpair P (cpair 2 (cpair Q R))))
     (cpair 2 (cpair (cpair 2 (cpair P Q)) (cpair 2 (cpair P R)))))).
Proof.
